event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":108,"item_id":"rs_0bab72121a3cddd0016acb4108ad4c8195b2cd096c52ccf15f","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing SSR Forms**\n\nI need to create concise Server-Side Rendered (SSR) forms that are accessible without needing JavaScript. I'll set up Node.js with HTTP and SQLite, ensuring there's a way to redirect users and display visible alerts. I'll handle both GET and POST routes for project creation. The HTML should be escaped, and I'll use default data in SQLite. Additionally, I need to run tests using Node's built-in spawn with a temporary database outside the repository to allow for restarts. I think I have enough time for this!"}

